{"id":"4813","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4813_main_cirrus-spissatus-and-fibratus-with-partial-22-solar-halo_clouds-photometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>该图像中的显著特征是在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密卷云</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛卷云</span>中发生的部分<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">22°光晕</span>。密卷云开始变厚，但是当看向太阳时，它还不够厚，看起来很灰。纤维细丝不规则弯曲或接近直；是白色的；并且具有比纤维（毛发状）外观更<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">柔滑的光泽</span>。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">6</span>处也可以看到几个凝结尾迹。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Danny Krull","location":"德国，01844 Neustadt in Sachsen, Polenz","latitude":"纬度: 51° 1' 37'' N","longitude":"经度: 14° 12' 3'' E","date":"16 September 2012 1059 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.4"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/4813_syn_cirrus-spissatus-and-fibratus-with-partial-22-solar-halo_clouds-photometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"></div>","copyright":"© 德国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/4813_upper_cirrus-spissatus-and-fibratus-with-partial-22-solar-halo_clouds-photometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>照片拍摄后3小时，在距北-北-西180公里处开展了探测，显示在过去的12小时内，高层的水分有所增加。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/4813_sat_cirrus-spissatus-and-fibratus-with-partial-22-solar-halo_clouds-photometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"></div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2012","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4718_main_cirrus-spissatus-mamma-and-cirrus-floccus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>在表面冷锋通路后，是密集的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密卷云</span>云片。这些云片<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">横向</span>于上层风而对齐，并且还显示出<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">对流发展</span>的迹象，表明它们的水平不稳定。在发展的初始阶段，一种独特的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">带有尾迹的絮状卷云云片</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">絮状卷云</span>证实了这一点。一些不明显的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乳房状云</span>更说明了这一点。</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"泽西岛圣布雷拉德","latitude":"纬度: 49° 10' 12'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 10' 9'' W","date":"22 June 2015 1954 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.4"}]}]}